<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">Corinthte Niina</book>
  <para style="h">Corinthte Niina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Corinthte Niina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Corinthte Niina</para>
  <para style="mt">Corinthte Niina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii deina taw Christ Jesus ii sawltakpa ahi Paul le ih suapuipa Timothy in — Corinth khua ah Pathian ii pawlpi le Achaia ngam bup ah Pathian ii mihingte theampo tungah lai kong thaak uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian le ih Topa Jesus Christ in thuthiamna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian le ih Topa Jesus Christ ii Pa, hesuak thiam Pa, huna theampo hong paina Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian tung pan ih saan hunate ma zanghin ngimna namcin a thuakte ih hu thei natu in, ama in ih ngimna theampo sungah hong hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Christ ii thuakna tam mama sungah ih kihel bangin Christ tungtawnin Pathian huna tam mama ih nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thuak uh le note atu in, huna le ngupna na nga natu uh hi a; kote hong kihu le note zongh hong kihu a, kote ii thuakte ma zong thinsau takin na thuak zawk natu thahatna hong kipia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom note sungah ka lametna uh sia ngawk zo ngeingawl hi; ko thuaknate nong thuak pui uh bangma in, huna ka nga uhte sungah note zongh na kihel uh sia ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suapuite awng Asia ngamkhen sungah ngim ka ngana uhte kong phawksak nuam hi. Kote tungah hong kisuanh vanhte lian mama a ngit leih ahikom, nungta tu zong ka ki um ngam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kote tungah thi daan hong kipia bangza in ka ngaisun uh hi. Ahihang hi thu sia, koma le koma kisuang ngawlin, a thite a thosak kik, Pathian khat bek ka suan thei natu uh in a piang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabang a kiitakhuai thithei natu panin, ama in hong ngum zo a, hong ngum lai tu hi; mai sang zongh ah ama in hong ngum kik lai tu hi, ci in lametna ama tungah ka nei zo uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua in kote nong panpui na uh taw thu nong ngetsakna uh hang ahi hi. Tua ahikom kote atu thu tam mama hong kingetsaknate hong kizo tu a, Pathian in ko thupha hong pia tu hi; tuaciang mihing tam mama in, kote atu nging takin lungdamkona nei thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi leitung ah ka nuntakna uh le a tuanin note taw ka kizopna uh sia Pathian ii hong piaksa thinmamna le citakna ii hong ukna le Pathian' thuthiamna ii vaangletna hang hi a, mihingte pilna hang hi ngawl hi, ci in telthiang in ka kiphasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sim thei tu le na tel thei tu teng bek kong at uh hi. Ahizong tu in a lalang bek hong tel tu na hi uh hang, ih Topa Jesus Ni hong thet ciang, note hu in ka kiphatsak uh bangma kote hu in na kiphatsak thei natu uh in a cing tak ma nong tel tu uh kong lamen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hite theampo thumaan hi ci in ka telthiang hu in, thupha niivei na nga thei natu in note kungah haw tu in ka ngeal phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Judea ngam ah ka khualhaw natu taw kisai in note tung pan huna dei ka hikom Macedonia ka pai lam le ka cia lamin note kungah baang tu in ka ngeal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi bang ka ngeal ciangin thukheal memeang nong sa uh ziam? Hi bangin ngealnate ka nei ciangin keima deina bek taw, “Hi hi,” le ci a, “Hi bo,” le a ci si tu in a om ka hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ii thumaan a son bang tatak ma in, note tungah kong kamciamna sia “Hi hi” cile “Hi bo” ci sia thu hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Silas, Timothy le keima ii kong hil Pathian Tapa Jesus Christ sia “hi” le “hi bo” ci khop tu hi ngawl hi; ama sia Pathian ii “Hi” a cisia pa ahi zaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, Pathian kamciam theampo tungah “Hi” a ci pa ahi hi. Hi thu hangin Jesus Christ tungtawnin, Pathian minthanna ah “Amen” ka ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note taw kingawm in kote Christ taw kipawl khawm a, ih nuntakna hong kipsak sia in Pathian hi a; eite hong tuam koisia Pathian ma hi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama ii neisa ka hina uh kote tungah tepteena hong koi zo a, eite atu hong koikholsak na theampo a kipsakna in eite thinsung ah Thaa Thiangtho hong pia pa in ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima tetti tu in Pathian ka sam hi — ama in ka thinsung hong he hi! Corinth khua ah kong pai ngawlna sia note kong maapna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na up hamtang tu uh thu sia hamtangin kong sawl buatu uh a, na upna uh kip hi ci in kong he uh hi. Noma lungdam natu in note taw na a seam khawm ka hizaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom note kong heesak ngawl natu in note kungah pai kik ngawl tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile note hong heesak thong leng kei hong lungdamsak tu akua om nawn tu ziam? Keima ii kong heesak te ma om bek tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hu in no tungah tua laithak kong at ahi hi — Keima hong lungdamsak tute ma in hong heesak tu ahiciang, no kungah pai tu ka uuk bua hi. Banghang ziam cile keima ka lung a dam le, note zongh lungdam ci in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lai kong thaak lai in thinsung buaingawpna le khuangaina taw thitui taakin lai kong at hi; ka tupna sia note kong heesak nopna hi ngawl a, bangza in note hong it khi ziam, ci in kong telsak nopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in mi khat pawpo in, mihing khat a khuangaisak le kei bek hong heesak hi ngawlin, a nobelin ci leang — note theampo hong heesak ahi hi. (Hi bangin ka ci sia ama tungah a nasia kamkhal ka pau nop ngawl hang ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note a tamzaw in hisia pa sia tu a bangma in daan pia zo na hi uh ciangin, pha zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu in bang po ahizong ama mawna maisak tavun a, hee leilam in a thin a lal ngawl natu in na hanthawn vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama na it takpi na uh na telsak natu in kong thuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua lai kong thaak sia banghang ziam cile ze etna sia bangbangin do zo a, tuaciangin kei ii hilna bangza dongin ni nu ziam ci in kong heak nop hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khat po ii a ngamtatna tungtaang ah mawna na maisak uh ciang, kei zongh in ama ka maisak hi. Banghang ziam cile maw ka maisak ciangin — tuabang a kul takpi ma ahile — Christ ii hong ompuina taw in note hang in mawmaisak ka hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Satan ngealnate he ka hikom in; ama hong nopzaw ngawl natu in ka maisak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha hil tu in Troas khua ka thet ciang tua munah Topa in nasep natu lampi hon sa in a koi ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang tualai ah ih suapuipa Titus mu zo ngawl ka hikom nasia takin ka thinngim hi. Tua ahikom tua munah a om mihingte mangpha thaak in Macedonia ah ka pai suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian tungah lungdamnate kiko tahen! Banghang ziam cile Christ taw kipumkhatna hu in, Pathian in Christ ii ngalzawna sungah a mat sate bangin Pathian in eite lam hong pui tawntung hi. Christ thu heakna sia mun theampo ah paaknamtui bangin a kizel natu in Pathian in eite hong zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite sia Christ ii Pathian tungah a piak paaknamtui taw ih kibang a, ngupna a ngate le a mangthangte sungah ih kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mangthangte atu in tuasia in ngual a thisak thei a ui mama thina ngim hi a; ahihang ngupna a ngate atu in nuntakna a pia ngimnamtui ahi hi. Tua ahile tuabang nasepte a seam zo tu akua om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kote sia Pathian thu takpi vanh ngina ngawl te zuak bangin a son midang tam mama te taw ka kibang bua uh hi; ahihang Pathian in hong sawl ahikom, thinsung maan tak taw ama mai ah Christ ii naseamte bangin thu ka son uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu a teng ih son ciang koma le koma a kisuangtaak kik bang hi nong sa uh ziam? Ngualdang pawlkhatte bangin note tungah piak tu ahizong, noma in ko tung a nong piak tu uh ahizong, kiheaksakna laite kul tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noma mama sia mihing theampo ii heak tu le sim tu in, kote lungtang tungah a ki at, ka nei uh laithak sia na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Christ ama mama in hi laithak at in kote puak tu in hong thaak a hina thu kitel mama hi. Tua lai sia laitui taw ki at ngawlin, a nungta Pathian ii Thaa taw ki at a, suangpheak tungah ki at ngawlin, mihingte lungtang tungah ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Christ tungtawnin Pathian ka muan uh manin hi bangin ka ci thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi nasep ka sep thei natu in koma sungah son ngam tu sep theina bangma ka nei bua uh hi. Tua sep theina ka nei uh sia Pathian kung panin hong pai ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lai taw ki at Thukham pan hi ngawl a, Thaa pan hong piang thuciamthak a tu in, hong seamsak thei sia ama ahi hi. A ki at thukham in thina piangsak a, ahihang Thaa in nuntakna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukham sia suangpheak tungah a kikhuak laimalte hi a, a kipiak laitakin, Pathian ii vaangletna kilangh hi. Moses ii maitang tungah a taang sia mial vaial ahihang nasia takin taang ahikom, tua laitak Israel mite in a maitang a salh zo bua uh hi. Thina hong puak Thukham in, ama hun sung tua za in vaangletna taw hong pai ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thaa ii tukna le dianna taw kisai vaangletna in bangza in nasia zaw tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kimawsakna a piangsak thu sia vaanglian ahile; ngupna a piangsak sia ii tukna le dianna sia bangza in vaanglian zaw tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua vaangletna a taangzaw pek sia hangin a bosa hunsung a, a taang mama sia ii vaangletna sia a bo zo hi, kici thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, tawmvei sung bek a kikhom sia sungah vaangletna om ahile a tawntungin a kikhomsuan vaangletna sia bangza in tamzaw kan tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi lametna ka nei uh hu in, kote ka hang mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote in a maitang pan a vaangletna, a mial vaial in a bona sia Israel mite ii mu ngawl natu in, dial taw a maitang a seal, Moses bang ka hi bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate thinsung kikhak takpi hi; amate in thuciamlui thubute a sim uh ciang tuni dongin, tua dial in a thinsung uh siin lai hi. Mihing khat in Christ taw a kizop ciang bek in, tua dial sia kihepsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuni ngawngawn dongin Moses Thukham a sim uh ciangin tua dial in amate thinsung siincip lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang kiheam thei hi. Moses thu laithiangtho sungah: “Topa sang ah a kiheak ciangin ama dial sia kiheam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu in hi lai sungah “Topa” ci in a ki at sia Thaa ahi hi; Topa ii Thaa omna munah suatakna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom eite theampo in, a kisiin ngawl maitangte taw Topa vaangletna kilanghsak vun. Thaa ahi Topa kung pan hong pai tua vaangletna sia ma in a nasia vaial vaangletna sungah ama ii pianzia bangin eite hong kheal hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in ama ii hong hesuakna taw hi nasep tu hong pia ahikom ka thin uh a kiam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuku theampo le a maizumhuai ngamtat nate theampo ka vawk uh hi; theamna taw na ka seam bua uh a, Pathian ii kammal zongh leilot thu ka suaksak bua uh hi. Pathian muna ah thumaanna ii a kicing khuavak sungah ka nungta uh a, mihing sim ii a pha in a tel thei natu ka hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, kong hil uh lungdamna thu kiseal ahile a mangthangte mun pan bekma in a kiseal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi leitung pathian ngilopa in amate thinsung sia khuazing sungah keamcip ahikom um ngawl uh hi. Pathian taw a kibang linlian Christ ii minthanna huvau tua Lungdamna Thupha pan hong pai, amate tungah hong taang khuavak a mu thei ngawl natu in ama in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, kote kong hil thu in koma ii thu ahi bua hi; Jesus Christ sia Topa hi ci in kong hil uh a, Jesus hangin note ii naseamte bang ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Khuazing sung pan khuavak hong taang tu hi!” a ci Pathian sia ma in Christ ii maitang ah a taang Pathian ii vaangletna heak natu in kote thinsung ah a khuavak hong taangsak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahitazong vaangletna lianbel sia Pathian neisa hi a, kote aa hi ngawl hi ci sia a kilak natu in thaa thu ah sumngum a nei kote sia tungbeal thawthong taw kibang khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote ngim nga nithi ka hi uh hang, ka lalcip bua uh a, khat vevei lungmang ka hi uh hang, thinkiam ngeingawl khu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ngal tam mama a om hang ngualtamh sel ngeingawl khu hi. Khat vevei nasia takin hong kiliamsua kale hong kisusia zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus ii nuntakna ka pumpi uh sungah a kimu thei natu in, ama thina sia, a thithei ka pumpi uh sungah ka vom top uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi a thithei ka pumpi uh pan ama ii nuntakna a kimu thei natu in, ka nuntak sung tawntung, Jesus hangin thi tu launa ka nei tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thina in kote sungah na hong seam hi, ahihang nuntakna in note sungah na hong seam hi, cinopna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Um ka hikomin ka son hi,” ci hi. Tua upna thin bangma in kote zongh in um ka hi uh hu in, ka son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Jesus sia nuntakna sungah a thosak kik Pathian in kote zongh Jesus taw hong thotosak tu a, note taw kingawm in ama omna munah hong la khawm tu hi, ci in ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hite theampo sia note atu hi a; Pathian ii thuthiamna in mihing a tam vaialte tungah a thet ciangin, amate in Pathian minthan natu in lungdamko thungetnate a tamzaw nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi thu hu in kote ka thin uh a kiam ngei bua hi. Ih pumpi cii le sa sia dadam in muamuat ahihang ih thaa nuntakna sia ni khat zawk ni khat hong kithaksua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciang, hi tawmvei hunsung ka thuak uh ngimna tawmnote in, tua ngimna sangin a tamzaw pek, a lian mama tawntung minthanna sungah kote hong then tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kimu thei nate mitsuan ka hi bua uh a, a kimu thei ngawl nate hizaw hi. A kimu theite sia tawmvei sung bek kikhom a, a kimu thei ngawlte sia a tawntungin kikhom hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, hi ih teenna buk — hisung leitung ah ih pumpi kisia le — a tawntungin a kikhomsuan tu, eite teen natu Pathian in vantung ah inn khat nei tu hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantung pan hong pai ih inn sia eite tungah hong kikhu natu ih thangaina sia, tu in nasia mama ahikom ih vuisa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuabangin tuasia hong kisilhsak ciangin eite sia pumpi nei ngawlin ih om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi leitung buk sungah ih teen laiteng in, hong kizothaw kisa in ih tau hi; tuabang ih ci ciang hi leitung pumpi suut nuam ih hi bua a, thi theina sia nuntakna taw hong kikheal natu in vantung pumpi sia ei tungah hong silhsak tu in ih deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in hi kikheal natu in, eite hong puuakhol a, ei atu hong kholsakte theampo hong kipsakna in ama ii Thaa hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom eite in thin letna taw ih kidim tawntung hi. Ih pumpi inn sungah ih om lai tengin, eite in Topa inn taw a kikhuala ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite in upna taw ih nungta a, muna taw ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Eite in thinletna taw ih kidim a, hi ih pumpi inn nusia in Topa taw om tu sia ih uuk zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi sung inn ah ahizong, tuasung inn ah ahizong thudang theampo sangin Ama ih lungkimsak tu sia ih deibel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite theampo thukhenna thuak tu in Christ mai ah ih ding nanak tu hi. Mihing khat simin a leitung pumpi nuntak sungah ama ii sepna a pha a sia taw a kiphu a kilawm in nga tek tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa kiitakna ii a cinopna ka he uh a, tua hu in, ngual zongh, tuabang ahithei natu in ka hanthawn uh hi. Pathian in kote sia a khawng a kheakin hong heak bangma in na thinsung uh ah, keima zongh hong he tu in kong muangmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note tungah ko le ko a kiphatson tu in a hanciam kik ka hi bua uh hi. Mihingte ngamtatna en ngawl a, a meal a sa en in a kisuangtaakte na zo kik thei natu in kote nong kiphatsak pui natu ahang sia hong lak nuam ka hizaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thin amh tatak ka hi uh ziam? Thin amh ka hi uh le Pathian atu hi a, tua ahibuale thinciim ka hi uh ziam? Tua ahile zong note atu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Christ hong itna in kote hong uk hi, tu in ahile mihing khat in mihing theampo atu thi hi ci in ka tel uh hi, tua in amate theampo sia ama thina sungah thi khawm hi a cinopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nungtate in amate atu nungta nawn ngawlin amate atu thi a, ahihang amate atu in nuntakna sungah a kithosak kik pa atu a nungta ahithei natu in ama in mihing theampo atu in thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, mihingte munate taw kuama tungah thu ka khen nawn bua uh hi. Khatvei lai in Christ sia mihing munate taw thukhen ngei ka hita uh zong tu in tuabangin ka khen nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing khat pawpo in Christ taw a kizom le ama in mihing thak ahi hi; a nuntakna lui sia bo in a thak hong piang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiteng theampo Pathian nasepna hi a, ama in Christ tungtawnin, a ngalte ih hina panin a lawmte hong suaksak zo a, ngualdangte zongh a lawmte ih suasak natu in, eite tungah vaipuak hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thupuak uh sia in Christ tungtawnin Pathian in mihing nam theampo ama lawmte hong suaksak hi, ci thu ahi hi. Pathian in amate mawna sazian keam ngawl a, tuaciang bangbangin ama in a lawmte suaksak cina thu ko hong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi sungah kote Pathian ma in kote tungtawnin note tungah hong thuum bangma in Christ atu in thuson ka hi uh hi. Christ ii taangin kong thuum uh hi: Pathian in a ngalte na hina uh pan, a lawmte hong suaksak tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama taw ih kipumkhatna hangin Pathian bang a, thumaan thutang ih sua thei natu in, mawnei ngawl Christ sia Pathian in eite taangin mawnei suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, Pathian taw ko ii nasep khopna sungah Pathian ii thuthiamna a saangte in, tua thu thiamna sia a luithawthong a suasak ngawl natu in kong thuum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian pauna ngai vun: “Note maipha kong piak tu hun hong thet ciang, note ngetna kong za hi; kong ngup tu ni hong thet ciang, note kong hu hi.” Ngai vun! Pathian ii hesuakna saan thei tu sia tu hun hi; hong kingup tu ni sia tuni ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nasepna uh taw kisai in khat pawpo ii mawna hong zon tu sia ka dei bua uh a, tua ahikom kuama haksatnate a nga natu in ka hanciam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ka sepna sung theampo ah Pathian naseamte ka hina uh ka lakna uh in, thinsau takin ngimna thuak zawkna, haksatna le buainate ka thuak kenkon zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote sia hong kivel a, thong sungah hong khumin, hong vawtsia uh hi; naseam leilam in, mu ngawlin, an ne ngawlin ka om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian naseamte ka hina uh sia thiangtho nuntakna, thu heakna, thinsauna le dikna — Thaa Thiangtho taw, ki itna tatak taw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a maan thuhilna le Pathian ii vaangletna teng taw ka lak uh hi. Thutang suana sia ka ngalhiam uh hi a, ngaldo natu le koma le koma kihuukna tu in ka nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote sia hong kithasia a, hong kizawngsak si hi; hong kilang a hong kipok si hi. Kote sia thumaan ka son uh hang a leilot theite bangin hong kivawt hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ngual theampo in hong he ahihang a kihe ngeingawlte bangin hong kivawt hi; nong mu uh bangma kote nungta napi a thisate bangin hong kivawt hi. Daan hong kipia ahizong, hong kithatlum ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hong heesak ahihang ka lung uh dam tawntung hi; a zawng bang ka hi uh hangin, mihing tam mamate ka hausak uh hi; neisa bangma nei ngawl tu bang ka hi uh hangin, na theampo a nei tatakte ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Corinth khua a om ka it lawmte awng! No tungah ip nei ngawlin kong son zo uh hi; ka thinsung kongkha uh kong hon siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note tungah kote in ka thinsung uh hong khakbil hi ngawlin; noma in kote sia na thinsung uh hong khabil nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in note sia ka tate bangin kong pau hi: note tungah kong nei uh thinpuak bangin, kote tungah thinpuak nong neina uh hong lak tavun. Na thinsung kongkha uh hongin na taanzausak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu um ngawlte taw kipawl tu sia suak thei ngawl ahikom amate taw kibangin na na seam khawm heak vun. A maan le a maan ngawl sia bangbangin kipawl khawm thei tu ziam? Bangbangin khuavak le khuazing sia teang khawm thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Christ le Doaimangpa sia bangbangin thu kisi thei tu ziam? Thu um khat in thu um ngawl khat taw bangbangin na khat nei khawm thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian ii biakinn sia doai biakna milimte taw bangbangin thukimna vawt thei tu ziam? Banghang ziam cile eite sia a nungta Pathian biakinn ih hi hi! Pathian in: “Ka mite sungah ka inn ka vawt tu a, amate sungah ka teang tu hi; keima in amate Pathian ka hi tu a, amate in keima mihingte ahi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin Topa in, “Amate nusia nanak in a, amate taw kikhen tavun. A thiangtho ngawlte taw kipeena bangma nei heak vun, tua hile note kong saang tu hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaanglianbel Topa in, Keima in note ii Pa kong hi tu a, note sia ka tapate le ka tanute na hi tu uh hi, ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka it ka lawmte awng, hi kamciamte theampo sia eite tungah hong kipia hi. Tua ahiciang pumpi le thinsung a ninsak thei nate theampo panin kithiansua in, Pathian ih thasiana taw a thiangtho sinsen suak tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kote na thinsung uh ah hong saang tavun. Kote kuama tungah khial ngawl khu hi; kuama siatsua ngawl, kuama tungah hamphatna la ngeingawl khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noma hong mawsak nuam a, tuabangin kong ci hi ngawl hi; banghang ziam cile tu masia a kong ci sa bangma in note sia kote atu in ithuai mama na hi uh hang in, ih thi zong ih nung zong, a omkhawm tawntung ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note kong muang mama hi; note hangin ka kisuangtaak hi! Thinngimna theampo sungah thin letna taw ka kidim lai hi; lungnopna taw ka kidim leet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia ka thet zawk uh ciang zong tawlngak hun ka nei bua uh hi. Haksatna sia mun theampo ah om a, ngual taw kihauna, thinsung patauna taw ka om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang a thinkiamte a han sua Pathian in Titus hong paina taw kote hong hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama hong pai hu bek hi ngawlin, noma ii ama na hanthotnate zongh hong ko hu in hong lungdamsak hi. Kei nong mu nop mama na thu, na khuangai mama na uh le kei nong huuk natu in a kinging sa in na omnate uh hong ko hi; tua ahikom tu in ka lungdam seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua kong laithak sia in note hong khuangaisak ahile zong, tua ka at sia ka hee tuan bua hi. Tuasia in tawmvei sung teng hong khuangaisak sia ka heak ciangin, khuangai nuam leng khuangai thei tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tu in ka lungdam hi — kong heesak hang hi ngawlin, na heena uh sia in no hong kikhealsak ahi hu in ka lungdam hi. Tua heena sia Pathian in zangh a, tua ahikom note atu in, bangma siatna kong piangsak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ih zak heena in ngupna nga natu in thin kikhealna piangsak hi — tua ii sungah bangma kisii natu om ngawl hi! Ahihang mihing ii heena lel bek in thina piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na heena uh sia Pathian in bangbang hi ziam ci sia en vun: tuasia in bangzata in nang hong lawpsak a, na maw ngawlna ah bangza in hong panpui nuam ziam! Tuabang thin uukna, patauna, thinsung phaw theinate, thangaina, a khialte daan piak nopna cite piangsak hi! Hi thu theampo ah note pau baang ngawl ci in noma le noma kilak zo nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua laithak kong at hang, a khialpa, ahibuale a thuakpa ngaisutna taw hong at hizaw ngawlin Pathian ii muna ah ko thu bangza in hong ni ci sia a kiheak natu hong at ka hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom tha ka nga mama uh hi. Tha ka nga uh bek dom ngawl hi; thinnopna a nga natu in note theampo in tha na piakna uh Titus ii lungdam hu in, ka lung uh hong damsak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Titus mai ah note hangin ka kisuangtaak a, kei nong thinkiamsak bua uh hi. Note tungah thumaan kong son tawntung bangma in Titus mai a ka kisuantaakna uh sia a maan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note theampo in bangbangin ama thupiakte ni nuam a, bangbangin liinna le launa taw ama zindo cisia a phaw ciang ama in note hong itna khang seseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na theampo ah note kong suan thei manin ka lungdam mama hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koma suapuite awng, Pathian ii thuthiamna in, Macedonia pawlpite sungah bang matutna nei ziam ci sia kong hesak nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thuak ngimna te taw amate nasia takin kize et hi; ahihang a lungdamna uh lian mama ahikom, amate zawng mama napi, piakna ah ngo thei mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ahi theiza uh pia a, a ci thei za tungsia ngawngawn zongh pia uh hi, ka ci ngam hi. Amate uuk thu in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judea ngam a om Pathian ii mihingte huna sungah a kihel thei lei natu in ko tungah hesuak hong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuate in kote lametna sang zonghin nasia zaw hi! A masa phit in amate Topa tungah kipia uh hi; tua zawkciang Pathian ii deina taw amate in kote tung zongh ah hong kipia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahiciangin hi nasep a pan Titus tungah a zopto suak natu le hi ki itna sungah sepna sia a khuangkhim dong na sep to thei natu in hong hu natu ka hanthawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note ii na nei uh ahi: thu upna, thusonna, thuheakna, midangte hu tu lawpna le kote nong itna uh theampo ah kicing mama nu hi. Tua ahikom in, itna taw kisai nasepna zong ah na ngo tatak tu uh kong dei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zui tu ngeinate hong koisak ka hi bua hi. Ngualdangte sia tua zata in ngual hu nuamin a lawpna thu kong lakna taw note zongh ngual na itna uh sia bangza ahi tatak ziam ci in ka tel nopna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna sia na heak uh hi; ama sia hau mama napi in, ama zawnna taw note a hau na sua thei natu in note atu in ama le ama a zawngin hong kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ngaisutna pan, ningkum a na patsa uh nasep sia tu in na man thiang tu sia phazaw hi. Note sia a diang phitte na hi uh dom ngawlin, dian tu a uukte zongh na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahiciang seam tan vet tavun a, man thiang tavun! Na ngeal uh lai in na lawp uh bangma in, man thiang tu zongh na lawp tavun a, tu in na neisun uh po taw naseam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Piak tu na thalawp uh le, na nei ngawlna tung pan hi ngawlin, na neina taw kizui in na piak tu za letsong sia Pathian in hong saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngualdangte noptuam natu in note tungah vanhngit hong suan nuam ka hi bua hi; ahihang tu laitakin note ci thei na hi uh ciang, a cimawte hu le uhte ma pha tu hi; tua hile note na cimawk hun ciang amate ci thei in no hong hu tu hi. Hi bangin noma ngeal a kikimin, na kihu vadiam tu uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laithiangtho in, “Tam a kaikhawm sia atu tam lei ngawl tu a, tawm a kaikhawm sia atu zongh tawm lei ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kote ii no kong hu nop uh bangma in Titus ii note lawp tak a hong husak Pathian tungah bangza in ka lung uh dam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kote ngetna hong saang bek hi ngawl hi; note hong hu tu sia lawp a, ama hantang in note kung hong zot tu sia ama thu taw khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungdamna thuhil nasepna ah pawlpi theampo ii a thasia mama ih suapuipa khat sia ama taw kong paisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia bek hi ngawlin, ngual ka hu nopna uh ka lak thei natu in Topa minthan natu ka sep suak uh, hi itna taw kisai nasepna sungah kote taw khual a haw khawm tu in pawlpi ii tealsa, a kiseesa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngo tak a, letsong kipiaknate ka zeakna uh ah kuama a phun ngawl natu in ka kidawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tupna uh sia Topa mai bek ah hi ngawlin, mihingte mai zongh ah a maan in a seam nuam ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih suapuipa sia amate taw kong paikhawmsak uh hi; tamvei ma a zia ka en zo uh a, a tawntungin ngual hu tu lawp mama hi ci in ka mu uh hi. Tu in ama in note tungah muanna hong nei tatak ciangin ama in ngual hu tu lawp vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Titus ahile, keima naseppui hi a, note hong hu tu in keima taw naseampa ahi hi; amate taw a kithawl suapui dangte sia pawlpite taangmi hi a, Christ minthangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note kong kiphatsak pui na uhte thumaan hi ci in pawlpi theampo in a tel natu in amate tungah na itna uh na lak tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judea ngam ah Pathian ii mihingte atu huna a kipuak huvau in, lai kong at sia a kul vateal hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note sia ngual hu nuamte hi ci in kong he hi, tuasia bangma in Macedonia mite tungah note kong kisuantaakpui hi. “Achaia a om suapuite in, ningkum panin huna pia nuam zo hi,” ci in ka na son hi. Noma lawpna in amate a tamzaw thawn zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi thu huvau note kong kiphatsak pui nate a luithawthong a sua ngawl natu in hi suapuite tu in kong paisak hi. Ahihang kong ci sa bangma in, amate na hu natu uh taw na kingingta khol vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong, note tungah ta za muanna hong kinei napi keima taw Macedonia pan mihingte kong pai uh ciangin, huna taw a kinging sa in om bua le uhte, note maizum tu bek son ngawlin, kote atu zongh bangza in maizumhuai tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikomin, piak tu na kamciamsa letsongte a kinging kholsa in a om natu in, keima kong pai ma, hi suapuite hong paikhol tu sia hanthot tu kul ka sa hi. Tua hile kei kong thet ciang, kingin sa suak tu a, tuaciang piak tu a kul hang hi ngawlin, thinzawna taw a pia nuam ka hina uh hong kilangh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thaicii tawm a poaipa in an tawm bek at tu a; tam a poaipa in an tam mama a at tu hi, ci in na phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hi a, mihing sim in ama khensat sa om bangin pia tu a, thinnop ngawlna taw, ahibuale piak nanak kul tu bangin ngaisutna taw pia ngawl tu hi; banghang ziam cile lungdam thinzo takin a pia sia Pathian in diksa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang noma atu in na kitaangsap theampo na nei tawntung natu le, thupha vawt natu theampo ah a kicing za sangin a tamzaw na nei natu in, Pathian in na kitaangsap za sangin a tamzaw hong pia thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Laithiangtho in: “Ama in a kitaangsamhte tungah ngo takin pia a; ama dikna sia a tawntungin a kikhomsuan hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Poai tu ancii le neak tu an hong pia Pathian in na kisap thaicii theampo zongh hong pia tu a, tuate po in, anlaak ciang nangma ii ngo tak a na piakna tung panin an na hau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in ngo takin a pia thei tawntung tu in, a khom in hong hausak tawntung tu hi; tuabangin letsong na piak uhte ko tung pan a nga uh ciang mihing tam mama in Pathian pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi piakna, nasepna in Pathian ii mihingte kitaangsapna bek a hu hi ngawlin, Pathian tungah nasia tak lungdamko honna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciangin hi nasepna tungtawnin a kimu thei thute hang in, na up uh Christ lungdamna thu tungah na thumaanna uh hu ahizong, amate le ngualdang theampo taw ngo tak a na kihopna uh hu ahizong, mihing tam mama te in Pathian minthangsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang in note tungah Pathian ii thuthiamna a lamdangin hong piak hu in, note atu amate in ki itna a thuk tatak taw thu hong ngetsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A manh a kisep zo ngawl letsong hong piak hu in Pathian tungah lungdamko tawng!
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima Paul in keima aituamin kong thuum hi — Note taw ka omkhop ciangin dikin cingh a, no taw a kikhuala a ka om ciangin hangsan hong kici hi. Christ cikna le thiamna hu in kei zongh note kung kong pai ciangin, ka hangsan a kul tu dong hong kivawt ngawl natu kong thuum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />banghang ziam cile, leitung deinate taw ngamta hi hong cite tungah hangsan thei khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a teang ka hi uh sia thumaan hi, ahihang leitung nate lungngulna taw ngalsim ka hi bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kidona sungah ka zak uh ngalhiamte sia leitung ngalhiamte hi ngawlin, kulh khote lalcipsak natu ka zak uh a thahat Pathian ii vaangletna ngalhiamte ahi hi. Kam kinialna maan ngawlte ka saatmit uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu heak natu hong nokkhaksak thei kiphatsakna teng ka sumit uh hi; ngaisutna a minpiang sia man in ka khumcip uh a, Christ ii thu ka nisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaciangin note na thumaanna uh na kitelthiangsak zawkciangin, thumaan ngawl ngamtatna pawpo daan pia tu in ka kinging tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Note sia a puatham omzia teng bek na en uh hi. Khat po in Christ ii neisa in a kituat a om ziam? Pha hi, ama le ama ngaisun kik tahen, banghang ziam cile kote zongh ama za ma in, Christ ii neisa ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa ii thuneina hong piakte hu in, ka kisuangtaak ngawp tha le zong ka mai a zum bua hi — tua thuneina sia no kong sukcip natu hi ngawlin, kong lapto natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lai kong thaakte taw no hong lausak nuam a, hanciam bang ka hi tu sia ka dei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khat po in, “Paul laithakte sia kamkhal kamciik veu zangh ahihang, ama tatak ei taw hong om ciang, ama thaneam in, a kammalte zongh bangma ahi tuan bua hi!” ci tha tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang mihing khat in note taw kong omkhop ngawl uh ciang laithakte sung kong at uh thu le, tua munah note taw kong om uh ciang ka vawt tu uh thute sia a kilamdang buatu hi ci in tel hamtang tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tatak ahile amate le amate a kiliansak mama te taw a kibangin, ka kituat bua a, ka kitee ngat ngam buatu hi. Amate bangza mawmaw ziam! Amate le amate ki en in, a kitee natu vawt tawm a khat le khat a kimuna za uh taw thukhente ahi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong ko ka hi uhle, ka kisuantaakna uh in, a omsa ciangtanna a vaal buatu uh hi; Pathian ii hong see sa a kiciangtan nasepte sung bek ah ka kisuangtaak uh a, no sungah na ka sep uh sia zongh kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciangtanna huam sungah om na hi uh ciang, Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha puakin note kungah kong pai uh ciangin tuate ka kan buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian hong koisak sa ciangtannate kalhin midangte sepna sungah ka kisuangtaak bua uh hi. Tua sangin Pathian hong koisak sa ciangtanna sung teng ah seam tawntung a, na upna uh khangto thei in note sungah ka nasepna uh a taangzai zaw thei tu in ka lamen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin Lungdamna Thupha sia note ii ngalkhat ngamte ah ka hil thei tu uh a, ngualdang khat ii lo sungah a kiseam sa nasep tungtaang ah kiphatsak natu a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang laithiangtho in, “A kuama po a kisuangtaak nuam sia in, Topa sep sa tungah kisuangtaak tahen,” a ci bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mihing khat sia, ama le ama pha a kisak ciang hi ngawlin, a phat takpi hunlam a kimu ciangin tua pa sia Topa in pha hi ci in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mawmaw phial zonghin, nong thuak zawk natu ka dei hi. Hong khual tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in note hong thinbot bangma in kei zongh in kong thinbot hi; note sia pasal khat bek taw kiteang tu a kamciam ka piaksa ngaknu thiangtho khat bang na hi uh a, tua pasal in Christ mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eve sia ngul ii leilot pilnate taw a theam bangma in — na thinsung uh lalin Christ tungah a kicing le a thiangtho in na kipiakna uhte na nusiat thaak tu uh ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kote ii kong hil Jesus ahi ngawl, Jesus a dang khat ii thu, hil a hong pai pawpo sia lungdamin saang nu hi; kote tung panin, na nga uh Thaa le lungdamna thu taw a kibang ngawl het thaa le lungdamna thu na saang uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note ii “sawltakte” na ci tuamte sangin kei sia bekcik zongh nozaw tuanin ka kingaisun bua hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu sonna ah a kipan tuung hi kaleng heakna ah tuabang ka hi bua het hi; hi thu sia hun theampo sung le a omzia theampo thiang takin kong son tawntung sa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian Lungdamna Thupha sia note tungah kong hil ciangin thaman bangma kong la bua a; noma kong thupi vawt na in keima le keima ka kiniamkhiak hi. Tuasia in khial ka hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note sungah kong sep laitakin pawlpi dangte in kei sia sum taw hong tham hi. Note kong hu natu in amate a suasuam ci tu bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note sungah na ka sep laitakin, huna sum ka kisap ciang, no kong konlaw bua hi; Macedonia pan hong pai suapuite in ka kisap theampo hong puak hi. A bosa hunsung bangma in mai sang zongh ah: note atu in vanhngit ka hi ngei buatu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Achaia ngam koima theampo ah hi keima kisuantaakna sia, kuama in hong khaam ngawl tu ci in ka sungah a om Christ ii thumaanna taw kong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kong it ngawl hu in hi bangin pau ka hi ziam? Pathian in note kong it hunlam hong tel hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua “sawltak” te in kote sep bangma ka seam uh ci in kisuantaak natu thu khat po a nei thei ngawl natu in, tu a ka sep teng ma ka seam tan lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua mihingte sia sawltak tatakte hi ngawl hi — amate sawltak maan ngawlte hi a, a nasepna huvau leilot in Christ sawltak tatak te bangin a kimealsealte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lamdang hi ngawl hi! Satan ngawngawn zongh khuavak vantunglalang khat taw kibang tu in, kimealseal thei lai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama ii naseamte in, thutang naseamte taw kibang tu in a kimealseal le a lamdangpi hi ngawl hi. A tawpna ah amate in a ngamtatnate uh taw a kiphu bang tatakin nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima sia a mawmaw in kuama in hong tuat heak hen kong ci kik hi. Ahizong tuabangin, nong ngaisun uh le zong, kiphatsak pui tu tawmno ka nei thei natu beak in a mawmaw khat bangin hong saang lamh tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu a ka papau teng ahile Topa ii hong pausak tute hi ngawl hi; hi kisuantaakna vai ah a mawmaw khat bangin ka pau takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang mihing ngaisutna lelte taw zong a kisuangtaak om ahiciang, kei zongh tuabang ma ka ngamta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noma tek ma ciim mama na hi uh komin, mihing mawmawte sia lungdam takin na dual uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note a uk bang po hong sawlte, note tung pan na neisa hong duupte, thaang taw hong siate, hong nomute ahibuale na maitang hong beangte khat pawpo na dual uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabangte vawt tu in ih lauthauh leihna teng ka pualaak tu sia ka maizum hi! Ahihang khat pawpo in bang khat po huvau in a kisuangtaak ngam le — a mawmaw bangin pau tu ci leang — kei zongh ka kisuangtaak ngam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate sia Hebrew mi ahi uh ziam? Kei zongh ka hi hi. Amate sia Israel te ahi uh ziam? Kei zongh ka hi hi. Amate sia Abraham suante ahi uh ziam? Kei zongh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate sia Christ ii naseamte ahi uh ziam? A mawmaw bang ka hi tha ta zong, amate sangin a phazaw naseampa ka hi hi! A nasia zaw in na ka seam a, thong zong tamvei ka taak zaw hi, tamvei hong kivel zaw a, a tamvei zaw ka thi dektak bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jew te in sawmthum le kuavei veu, ngavei tak hong saat hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />thumvei sia Rome mite in hong saat hi; khatvei sia suangtum taw hong kihua hi. Thumvei teambaw lal ka tawk a, khatvei sia nai kul le nai li sung tui sungah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka khualhawna tam mama sungah namthuamna pan, ngualsuamte pan, Jew mipuite le Gentile te tung panin, lauhuaina ka thuak hi; khuapi sung, duisung ngampa, tuipi tung le ngualtamh thumaan ngawlte tung panin lauhuaina tuatuam ka thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nasep thil vawt kitatsat ngawl a, mut ka nga ngawl hun tamvei mama hi; ka ngilkial hun le ka dangko hun om a; an ngina ka neak ngawl hun, belh tu nei ngawlin, puansilh ka nei ngawl hun tam pheivei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thildang a vaal lai, pawlpite theampo atu in, ka thinbotna in, ni simin ka ngim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihing khat po a tha zawm ciangin, kei zongh in ka tha zawmpui hi; khat po mawna sungah a puk ciangin, thin heena taw ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kisuantaak tu a kul le zong, ka thazawmna hong laknate tungah ka kisuangtaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa Jesus ii Pathian le Pa — a tawntungin ama min in thupha nga tahen! — tua Pathian in ka leilot ngawl hunlam hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Damascus khua ah ka om lai in Kumpipa Aretas khutnuai a om ngamkhen uk mangpa in kei hong mat natu in khuapi kongpite ah a cingte koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang khuapi luphung vang khat panin bawm khat taw kei hong kikhiaksuk ciang ama kung pan ka suakta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangma phattuamna om ngawl ahitazong, ka kisuangtaak kul tu hi. Ahihang tu in Topa hong piak mukholnate le thupualaaknate huvau kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu nung kum sawm le kum li lai in Tapidaw khat sia vantung a saang belna ah kila to hi ci in ka he hi. (Hisia in a piang tatak ma ziam maw, mukholna khat nei ahi ziam ci sia ka he bua hi — Pathian bek in he hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khatvei hong ci kik leng, hisia pa sia Paradise ah kila to hi ci in ka he hi. (Tusia zong a piang tatak ma ziam maw mukholna nei ziam ci sia ka he bua hi — Pathian bek in he hi.) Tua munah kammal taw a kilo thei ngawl, mihing kam le muk ii son thei ngawl kamte ama in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom hisia pa huvau ka kisuangtaak tu hi — ahihang ka thazawmna hong kilanghsak thute simngawl keima tungtaang ah ka kisuangtaak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi ka son thu in thumaan ahikom, kisuangtaak nuam leng zong a mawmaw ka hi tuan buatu hi. Ahihang kisuangtaak ngawl tu khi hi, banghang ziam cile ka pauna hong kizaakna le ka sepna hong kimuna za sangin a vaalin kuama ii hong thupi ngaisut tu ka dei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lamdang tam mama ka mute hu in, kiphatsakna taw ka kisakthei ngawl natu in keima pumpi sungah hong zo tu in Satan sawltak khat bangin na a seam, a bot pumpi natna khat hong kipia ahikom, ka kiphatsak ngawl natu in hong khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hisia hong laak keaksak natu in tua huvau Topa tungah thumvei thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang ama ii hong zona in: “Ka thuthiamna in nang atu in kicing hi, banghang ziam cile na thazawm ciangin keima vaang sia lianbel hi,” hong ci hi. Christ ii vaangletna in kei tung panin hong dalna ka phaw natu in, ka thazawmnate hu in ka kiphatsak sia ka lungdam belna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Christ atu in thazawmna, kiselnona, haksatna, vawtsiatna le buainate ah ka lung a kim hi. Banghang ziam cile ka thazawm ciangin a thahat ka suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima sia a mawmaw bangin ka ngamta hi — ahihang noma in tuabang a ngamta tu in nong vawt uh hi. Note in kei nong deina a lak tute na hi uh hi. Banghang ziam cile bangma ka hi ngawl hangin, note ii a lamdang tuamin na ngaisut uh “sawltakte” sangin ka nozaw tuan bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sawltak ka hina a kilak natu in nalamdang laknate le a lamdangte tam mama note sungah hong kivawtte sia thinsauna tatak taw hong kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sum taw huna tu kong konlaw ngawl sia simngawl, pawlpi dangte sangin a siazaw in kong vawtna bangbang om ziam? Nong hesuakna in tuabang ka phat ngawlnate hong maisak tavun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu in no kungah hong haw tu in thumvei ka kithoai zo a — note tungah bangma kong ngen buatu hi. Ka dei sia in na sum na paai uh hi ngawl a, noma mama na hi uh hi. A tatakin ci leang tate in nute pate a vaak tu hi ngawlin, nute pate ii tate a vaak tu hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nei theampo ka nuntakna dongin note kong hu natu in lungdam takin ka zangh siat tu hi. Tua za in kong it mama hu in, nong itna uh khiam zaw pumsai tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kei sia note atu in vanhngit ka hi ngawlna maan na sa tu uh hi. Ahizong khat po in kei sia theamna zangh thei a, leilotnate taw note hong aitaa hi hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamtai kong paisakte khat po tungtawnin note tung panin noptuam kong la ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Titus in hong pai in, Tapidaw suapui dang khat hong tonpui natu in keima nget ahi hi. Titus in a kilawm ngawlin, no tung pan laak hong nei ci tu nu ziam? Ama le kei sia a kibang tupna te tungtawnin a kibangin ngamta hi ngawl khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note mai ah a tawntungin koma le koma kipanghong bangin, nong ngaisun tha tu uh hi. Hi ngawl hi! Pathian mai ah Christ ii pau le hong oai bangin ka pau uh a, ka it lawmte awng, na ka vawt theampo uh sia, noma kong hu natu a, a kivawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No kung kong thet ciangin kong dei bang na hi ngawl na uh kong mu tu le, kei zongh nong dei uh bang ka hi ngawlna nong mu tu ka lau hi. Kihauna le ki eenna, thintomna le kaangsung heakna, kiselnona le kingensiatna, kiphatsakna le kilemngawlna te ka mu tu ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kong pai kik ciangin, a bosa hun sung note tam mama in mawna na vawt uh a, cii le sa deina taw nu le pa mawna te — paktat ngamtatnate pan a kisiik kik ngawl mawneite hu in, keima ka kap tu a, note mai ah ka Pathian in kei hong maizum sak tu ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in tu in note kungah a thum veina haw tu in kong paina ahi hi. “Kimawsiatna khat pawpo sia tetti nii ahibuale a tamzaw ii tetti panna taw kipsak kul hi.” — laithiangtho ci bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hun bosa sungah mawna a vawt sa note tung le ngualdang theampo tungah kong son nuam hi; tu masia a, a nii veina kong pai lai in, hong ci zo khi hi, ahihang, tu in note kung pan a khualana ah om ka hi ciang hong ci kik tu khi hi: kong pai kik ciang ahile kuama daan thuakna taw na kipeal thei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Christ in keima tungtawnin hong ci tatak ma a hina tetti lakna na dei uh teng na nga tu uh hi. Ama in note taw hong sep khop ciang, a thazawm bua hi; a vaangletna no sungah hong lak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, thinglamtee tungah a kithisakna in, thazawmna khat ahitazong, Pathian ii vaangletna taw ama nungta hi. Ama taw ih pumkhatna ah eite zongh ih thazawm hi; ahihang note taw ih kizopna ah ama ii nuntakna sung a om Pathian ii vaangletna sia ih siim khawm tek tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Upna sungah na nungta uh ziam ci in na kitel natu in, noma le noma kisit vun a, noma le noma thu na kikhen vun. Christ Jesus in note sungah hong nungta hi ci in na he tatak na uh ziam? — noma a cingtaak ngawl het na hi buana uh le he tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote ii lel ngawl hunlam noma tel tu in kong um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kote zawna a lak tu hi ngawlin, ko sia a lelte bang zongh hi tha tu ka hi uh hang, a maan sia na sep thei natu in na tatkhial ngawl natu Pathian tungah thu kong ngetsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile kote in thumaan thutak langpanin a seam thei te ka hi bua uh a, a panpui bek ka hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko ka thazawm uh ciang, na thahat uh sia ka lung uh dam hi. Tua ahiciang note sia na cialcing thei natu in thu kong ngetsak si uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hangin, hi lai sia no taw ih khualat laitak kong at ahi hi; note hong susia tu hi ngawlin, note kong puuaphat nopna in, Topa hong piak thuneina zanghin — no kung kong thet ciang hangsanin kong ci a kul ngawl natu in lai hong ngal thaak ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang tu in suapuite awng, mangpha na man tavun! Cialcin natu na hanciam vun; kong thuumna hong ngai tavun; khat le khat na kithukim vun a; kilem takin na nungta vun. Tuaciangin ki itna le thinnopna — Pathian sia note taw hong omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khat le khat sia suapui kinapna taw na kivaitha tavun. Pathian ii mihing theampo in paupuina kam hong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna, Pathian ii itna le Thaa Thiangtho ii hong pawlpuina in note theampo taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
